Used for the anti-air and mortar, and for hostile tanks, IFVs, SPAAG, and artillery.

The player tank is the owner's M1 Abrams (assets/models/m1_abrams_hull.glb and m1_abrams_turret.glb), a Meshy AI model kept at full resolution (3.28 million triangles, original 2048 PBR textures), split into hull and turret so the gunner seat can aim it.

The player cargo truck, Humvee, MRAP and Stryker (assets/models/) are the owner's full-resolution models. The truck and MRAP are split into two body pieces so each file stays under GitHub's 100 MB limit. The Stryker Mk 19 is a separate mesh and traverses.

Escort and hostile helicopters are original meshes made for this project. No vehicle is copied from Arma 3 or Bohemia Interactive.
License texts for the CC0 packs are in assets/cc0/.
